{
    "title": "Mini Soccer Star",
    "description": "Welcome to the MINI SOCCER STAR - 2024 USA CUP & MLS\r\n\r\nPlay the brand new soccer game Mini Soccer Star and enjoy the real and immersive soccer experience. Become the new soccer star player!\r\n\r\nMake a name for yourself in the soccer world by playing football matches. Gain popularity and become the new soccer superstar!\r\n\r\nPlay matches in your dream league, strike and score goals, win the cup and become the world champion!\r\n\r\nOur physics-based soccer simulation system gives you an amazing gaming experience.\r\nThere are tons of real teams and leagues/cups from mls, premier, bundes, la liga and even national teams. \r\nYou can join the most famous European football clubs and play for usa country in the world league. Eventually you will become a football super star!\r\n\r\nFEATURES: \r\n\u26bd You can play offline soccer games\r\n\u26bd Lots of real soccer teams and leagues/cups\r\n\u26bd Career mode of a soccer player\r\n\u26bd Goalkeeper mode\r\n\u26bd Advanced animation system and AI\r\n\u26bd Super simple controls - just swipe and tap\r\n\u26bd Addictive soccer training challenges\r\n\u26bd Lots of player customization options\r\n\u26bd Save your big goals at any time\r\n\u26bd Stylized game graphics\r\n\u26bd Optimized game size to save your precious storage space\r\n\u26bd Google Play Services Achievements and Leaderboards\r\n\r\nWe would love to hear from you! Please write to:\r\nsupport@vivastudios.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the MINI SOCCER STAR - 2024 USA CUP &amp; MLS<br><br>Play the brand new soccer game Mini Soccer Star and enjoy the real and immersive soccer experience. Become the new soccer star player!<br><br>Make a name for yourself in the soccer world by playing football matches. Gain popularity and become the new soccer superstar!<br><br>Play matches in your dream league, strike and score goals, win the cup and become the world champion!<br><br>Our physics-based soccer simulation system gives you an amazing gaming experience.<br>There are tons of real teams and leagues/cups from mls, premier, bundes, la liga and even national teams. <br>You can join the most famous European football clubs and play for usa country in the world league. Eventually you will become a football super star!<br><br>FEATURES: <br>\u26bd You can play offline soccer games<br>\u26bd Lots of real soccer teams and leagues/cups<br>\u26bd Career mode of a soccer player<br>\u26bd Goalkeeper mode<br>\u26bd Advanced animation system and AI<br>\u26bd Super simple controls - just swipe and tap<br>\u26bd Addictive soccer training challenges<br>\u26bd Lots of player customization options<br>\u26bd Save your big goals at any time<br>\u26bd Stylized game graphics<br>\u26bd Optimized game size to save your precious storage space<br>\u26bd Google Play Services Achievements and Leaderboards<br><br>We would love to hear from you! Please write to:<br>support@vivastudios.com",
